---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import Header from '../components/Header.astro'; import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'; import Icons from '../components/Icons.astro';
const items=[['Product range','Available varieties or breeds should be listed here once confirmed.'],['Pack options','Add packaging formats and DFL quantities after operational sign-off.'],['Availability','Confirm seasons, lead times and service regions before publishing.'],['Documentation','Batch and quality documentation can be shared where available.']];
---
<BaseLayout title="Our DFLs | DFL Eggs"><Header /><main><section class="page-hero blue"><div class="wrap narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Our DFLs</p><h1>Quality starts with a carefully handled <em>laying.</em></h1><p>Disease-Free Layings are the starting point for a sericulture cycle. DFL Eggs is designed to provide a clearer, quality-first route to access them.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/#enquiry">Check availability <span>→</span></a></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap info-cards">{items.map(([title,copy])=><article><Icons name="check"/><h3>{title}</h3><p>{copy}</p></article>)}</div></section><section class="section handling"><div class="wrap two-col"><div><p class="eyebrow">Receiving DFLs</p><h2>Care after delivery is part of a strong <em>start.</em></h2></div><div><p>Storage, handling and timing guidance should be provided with each confirmed order. Always follow the product-specific instructions supplied with the relevant batch.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Confirm the package is received in good condition.</li><li>Keep the product under the advised storage conditions.</li><li>Review batch and handling information before use.</li><li>Contact the team promptly if support is needed.</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap cta-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow light-eyebrow">Availability enquiry</p><h2>Tell us what you need.</h2></div><a class="button button-white" href="/contact/#enquiry">Check availability <span>→</span></a></div></section></main><Footer /></BaseLayout>
